# Defense in depth for additions to the allowlist.
**/.git/**
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.local/**
**/.streamlit/secrets.toml
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/authorization*.json
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.csv
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/*.doc
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.onnx
**/tests/**
test_*.py

